From: Cyryl Sochacki <cyrylsochacki@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] intl: Polish label for system shutdown

"Zamknąć" (infinitive, "to close") reads like closing RetroArch.
Name the entry after what it does: "Zamknij system" (shut down the system).

---
--- a/intl/msg_hash_pl.h
+++ b/intl/msg_hash_pl.h
@@ -13491,7 +13491,7 @@
    )
 MSG_HASH(
    MENU_ENUM_LABEL_VALUE_SHUTDOWN,
-   "Zamknąć"
+   "Zamknij system"
    )
 MSG_HASH(
    MENU_ENUM_LABEL_VALUE_FILE_BROWSER_OPEN_UWP_PERMISSIONS,
